{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"刚才的温柔一退开，他忽然怔住，像又落回最初的悬空。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M3\", \"M22\", \"M29\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"因为温柔虽能短暂回来，却不能延续亲近，而他也不甘心亲近只剩安慰。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S07\", \"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M3\", \"M29\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"这次他认出，悬空牵动的是刚刚真实发生过、却没能继续的亲近。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S06\", \"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M22\", \"M27\", \"M13\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"起初这份在意尚未命名；如今他已尝过亲近的安慰，也知道它不能因此延续。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S06\", \"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M13\", \"M18\", \"M22\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"原先的问题又摆到面前，他一时想不出下一步，刚才的安静无法替他作答。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\", \"S05\", \"S06\", \"S07\", \"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M2\", \"M3\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"因为他试过站稳、急切、珍惜和等待，却没有一种能让亲近继续发生。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\", \"S05\", \"S06\", \"S07\", \"S08\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M2\", \"M3\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，最初的悬空会在温柔无法延续时重新出现；这次他已能认出，它牵动的是刚刚真实发生过的亲近。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11f8337c-4da4-4bb7-9c14-ff299633696e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T003716183218Z", "elaps